    "description": "Xie Yuwang is a new actor who has experienced countless failures in auditioning for roles. He came to Paris after the epidemic to find his girlfriend Peng Jing, who had proposed a break-up with him.  The actress Wang Yang, who had made some achievements in her career, gave up her Chinese career and came to Paris to seek new opportunities.  Benny Sang, a student studying in the Netherlands, provided companion services for men in Europe and used the money he earned to travel around the world.  Director Tang Shupei has lived in France for ten years and is preparing his second feature film.  These four people met and separated in Paris and Cannes due to a mysterious fate. In the process, they rediscovered the deeper meanings of love, identity, and authenticity.",
